#!/bin/sh
# Tell Atlas where PhotonVision's web UI is: the device package's identity
# endpoint reports /etc/pd-device/manage-url as manage_url. The hostname is
# per board (set at boot by pd-device-hostname), so this runs every boot.
set -eu
host=$(hostname)
mkdir -p /etc/pd-device
url="http://${host}.local:5800/"
[ "$(cat /etc/pd-device/manage-url 2>/dev/null || true)" = "$url" ] && exit 0
printf '%s\n' "$url" >/etc/pd-device/manage-url.tmp
mv -f /etc/pd-device/manage-url.tmp /etc/pd-device/manage-url
